                                        "entry_id": "24a1a4a2-51c7-3b61-ac63-05246492ea1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything of small value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8c626c3-ec3c-488c-a27d-fe9828accb86",
                                                "sense_id": "62b7639a-efd1-31c0-a582-f099760998de",
                                                "text": "’Tis not worth a single stiver, said the bandy-leg'd drummer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "810a3aa7-bb5e-45ff-b8f1-945ce792087b",
                                                "sense_id": "62b7639a-efd1-31c0-a582-f099760998de",
                                                "text": "[A]ll hands, including the captain, received certain shares of the profits called lays […] And though the 275th lay was what they call a rather long lay, yet it was better than nothing; and if we had a lucky voyage, might pretty nearly pay for the clothing I would wear out on it, not to speak of my three years' beef and board, for which I would not have to pay one stiver."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
